&lt;p&gt;We are a company who is going to make a difference in the industries and the communities in which we choose to operate.&amp;nbsp; Every employee of Re:Build will share ownership in the company and will share in the financial rewards of the success we achieve together, at all levels of the company!&lt;/p&gt;
